    <div>
      <p begin="00:06.850" end="00:09.340" ttm:agent="v1">Lord Nightwad, project of desire</p>
      <p begin="00:09.340" end="00:12.310" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">To get up out the project, only thing that I desire (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="00:12.310" end="00:15.330" ttm:agent="v1">You know about Carolina? Gates carry the bottom</p>
      <p begin="00:15.330" end="00:18.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Where niggas murder for hire, stay fly and return fire (Jahlil Beats, holla at me)</p>
      <p begin="00:18.370" end="00:21.150" ttm:agent="v1">Discrepancy with your partner, I'm paralyzing the driver</p>
      <p begin="00:21.150" end="00:24.350" ttm:agent="v1">In the bend with the cement, and paralyzing survivor</p>
      <p begin="00:24.350" end="00:27.600" ttm:agent="v1">Hate when somebody pray for me, niggas plotting on taking me</p>
      <p begin="00:27.600" end="00:30.560" ttm:agent="v1">Pussy wants me squirted, I heard that he got some cake on me</p>
      <p begin="00:30.560" end="00:33.300" ttm:agent="v1">Scheming, trying to make my body bleed on the corner</p>
      <p begin="00:33.300" end="00:36.290" ttm:agent="v1">I fuck with God, that's the man that make you breathe every morning</p>
      <p begin="00:36.290" end="00:39.760" ttm:agent="v1">Walk off faith, I'm thugging hard, I'm connected to a high power</p>
      <p begin="00:39.760" end="00:42.780" ttm:agent="v1">High power fiber, optic firing objects</p>
      <p begin="00:42.780" end="00:45.970" ttm:agent="v1">High power assault rifle, firing objects</p>
      <p begin="00:45.970" end="00:48.820" ttm:agent="v1">High power, no dislikes getting acknowledged</p>
      <p begin="00:48.820" end="00:52.020" ttm:agent="v1">High power, greatest creation, sense of accomplishment</p>
      <p begin="00:52.020" end="00:54.970" ttm:agent="v1">I accomplished it, and you suck a suck at accomplishing</p>
      <p begin="00:54.970" end="00:57.860" ttm:agent="v1">Anything at all, but still will get involved</p>
      <p begin="00:57.860" end="01:00.740" ttm:agent="v1">I swear I get it, you won't get a benefit at all</p>
      <p begin="01:00.740" end="01:03.760" ttm:agent="v1">Hate the ridicule, but you possess the pitifullest talk</p>
      <p begin="01:03.760" end="01:06.810" ttm:agent="v1">Real niggas tend to be frank, don't partake in pillow talk</p>
      <p begin="01:06.810" end="01:10.060" ttm:agent="v1">You break gorillas off and say a lot about your character</p>
      <p begin="01:10.060" end="01:13.390" ttm:agent="v1">Secret decree, computer screen, deletion of a character</p>
      <p begin="01:13.390" end="01:16.470" ttm:agent="v1">I'ma marry her, ring finger got her carousel</p>
      <p begin="01:16.470" end="01:19.450" ttm:agent="v1">You don't see me mingling with my people? Don't embarrass us</p>
      <p begin="01:19.450" end="01:22.330" ttm:agent="v1">I could give her all to get you slaughtered and embarrass you</p>
      <p begin="01:22.330" end="01:25.340" ttm:agent="v1">Back you off the balcony, falcon without a parachute</p>
      <p begin="01:25.340" end="01:28.300" ttm:agent="v1">Back you off the balcony, falcon, and start harassing you</p>
      <p begin="01:28.300" end="01:31.380" ttm:agent="v1">They're gonna look abrasive, look who gone stupid</p>
      <p begin="01:31.380" end="01:34.440" ttm:agent="v1">B, YMCMB want me to get with Tunechi</p>
      <p begin="01:34.440" end="01:37.390" ttm:agent="v1">First in the 6th lane, disperse to this bitch's brain</p>
      <p begin="01:37.390" end="01:38.890" ttm:agent="v1">Curtains, I'm out of work</p>
      <p begin="01:38.630" end="01:42.080" ttm:agent="v1">I'm out of work, out of courtesy, clergyman in emergency</p>
      <p begin="01:42.080" end="01:45.010" ttm:agent="v1">I do this on certainty, I mean certainly</p>
      <p begin="01:45.010" end="01:46.660" ttm:agent="v1">Who could come collide with him?</p>
      <p begin="01:46.660" end="01:49.750" ttm:agent="v1">Wanna stay alive, you better stay on the side of him</p>
      <p begin="01:49.750" end="01:52.660" ttm:agent="v1">Jordan at the line, this Shaq, bitch, I'm Iverson</p>
      <p begin="01:52.660" end="01:55.720" ttm:agent="v1">Cross you at the line, this Shaq, bitch, I'm Iverson</p>
      <p begin="01:55.720" end="01:58.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Keep the money flipping, it's all I know (huh)</p>
      <p begin="01:58.750" end="02:01.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Been in and out of prison for a while, I know (huh)</p>
      <p begin="02:01.630" end="02:04.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Who up in the ghetto, thuggin' in the game? (Huh)</p>
      <p begin="02:04.720" end="02:07.740" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">They did their best to break us, but forever we remain (huh)</p>
      <p begin="02:07.740" end="02:10.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And taking, and taking (dog) and taking (I'm a dog) and taking</p>
      <p begin="02:10.700" end="02:13.600" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And taking (I'm a dog) and taking, and taking (I'm a dog)</p>
      <p begin="02:13.600" end="02:15.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And taking, and taking (bitch, I'm a dog) and taking</p>
